WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.902 --> 00:00:12.669
&gt;&gt;&gt; George Santos is under

00:00:12.803 --> 00:00:14.738
investigation by the FBI for

00:00:14.872 --> 00:00:17.107
allegedly stealing $3,000 from a

00:00:17.241 --> 00:00:19.243
dying dog's gofundme.

00:00:19.376 --> 00:00:24.348
The dog's owner and Navy veteran

00:00:24.481 --> 00:00:25.916
said that FBI investigated him

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:27.551
and they're elated that they're

00:00:27.684 --> 00:00:28.018
investigating.

00:00:28.352 --> 00:00:29.453
Santos is not worried as he

00:00:29.586 --> 00:00:31.355
dodged questions though about

00:00:31.488 --> 00:00:33.390
the federal investigation.

00:00:33.524 --> 00:00:34.758
&gt;&gt; Are you concerned about the

00:00:34.892 --> 00:00:35.292
FBI investigation?

00:00:35.426 --> 00:00:36.560
&gt;&gt; I am not.

00:00:36.693 --> 00:00:38.362
&gt;&gt; Have you spoken to him?

00:00:38.462 --> 00:00:39.997
&gt;&gt; Mr. Santos?

00:00:40.364 --> 00:00:41.298
You're facing a federal

00:00:41.432 --> 00:00:42.032
investigation here.

00:00:42.366 --> 00:00:43.901
This is very serious.

00:00:44.034 --> 00:00:46.937
Can you explain to your voters

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:48.639
and your constituents what

00:00:48.772 --> 00:00:50.908
happened with this veteran?

00:00:51.041 --> 00:00:54.378
The conversations that you had

00:00:54.378 --> 00:00:54.545
with him?

00:00:54.678 --> 00:00:55.646
Mr. Santos?

00:00:55.779 --> 00:00:57.147
&gt;&gt; Santos not answering

00:00:57.281 --> 00:00:57.648
questions there.

00:00:57.781 --> 00:00:59.583
But the dog's owner did speak to

00:00:59.716 --> 00:01:01.585
don last month about the

00:01:01.718 --> 00:01:04.888
incident and what happened.

00:01:05.022 --> 00:01:06.390
&gt;&gt; This guy, he doesn't deserve

00:01:06.457 --> 00:01:07.224
to be where he's at.

00:01:07.357 --> 00:01:08.425
He doesn't deserve a government

00:01:08.559 --> 00:01:08.926
pension.

00:01:09.059 --> 00:01:12.463
But when I saw him on the news,

00:01:12.596 --> 00:01:15.365
I put two and two together.

00:01:15.499 --> 00:01:16.900
It ripped the scab off and felt

00:01:17.034 --> 00:01:18.402
like my dad died yesterday.

00:01:18.402 --> 00:01:19.970
It hurt me that much again.

00:01:20.404 --> 00:01:21.772
I don't want you to hurt anybody

00:01:21.905 --> 00:01:23.173
like you hurt me again, George.

00:01:23.307 --> 00:01:24.408
Nobody should have to go through

00:01:24.541 --> 00:01:24.875
that.

00:01:25.008 --> 00:01:27.277
I almost killed myself when that

00:01:27.411 --> 00:01:27.711
dog died.

00:01:27.845 --> 00:01:28.579
That's why I'm here.

00:01:28.712 --> 00:01:29.880
I don't want him to be able to

00:01:30.013 --> 00:01:32.649
do this again.

00:01:32.783 --> 00:01:35.419
&gt;&gt; And he joins us now with the

00:01:35.552 --> 00:01:36.620
founder of the New Jersey

00:01:36.753 --> 00:01:38.422
veterans network that tried to

00:01:38.422 --> 00:01:39.289
intervene and help get the money

00:01:39.423 --> 00:01:39.590
there.

00:01:39.723 --> 00:01:40.524
Thank you both for joining us

00:01:40.657 --> 00:01:41.091
back again.

00:01:41.225 --> 00:01:42.593
That was such a powerful

00:01:42.726 --> 00:01:44.595
interview that you had with don

00:01:44.728 --> 00:01:46.430
and so much happened since then

00:01:46.563 --> 00:01:47.731
including the FBI reaching out

00:01:47.865 --> 00:01:48.432
to you.

00:01:48.432 --> 00:01:50.000
What were the questions for you?

00:01:50.434 --> 00:01:52.436
&gt;&gt; I can't really get into the

00:01:52.436 --> 00:01:53.170
exact details about the

00:01:53.303 --> 00:01:53.837
questions they asked.

00:01:53.971 --> 00:01:55.305
I did, however, provide them

00:01:55.439 --> 00:01:56.440
every piece of evidence that

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:57.074
they needed.

00:01:57.207 --> 00:01:58.075
I don't have anything to hide

00:01:58.442 --> 00:01:58.642
from them.

00:01:58.976 --> 00:02:01.845
I want them to pursue this.

00:02:01.979 --> 00:02:02.913
He didn't just break the law.

00:02:03.046 --> 00:02:04.781
He broke my heart when he did

00:02:04.915 --> 00:02:05.082
this.

00:02:05.215 --> 00:02:06.450
I don't usually like to go after

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:07.284
people and have them get in

00:02:07.417 --> 00:02:09.887
trouble or anything like that.

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:11.421
But you break the law, and you

00:02:11.555 --> 00:02:12.990
break my heart, and you put me

00:02:13.123 --> 00:02:13.657
through something like this

00:02:13.790 --> 00:02:14.925
where I thought that I was going

00:02:15.058 --> 00:02:17.461
to have my dog taken care of and

00:02:17.594 --> 00:02:18.862
then I just had to sit there and

00:02:18.996 --> 00:02:21.632
watch her die and I couldn't do

00:02:21.765 --> 00:02:22.466
anything about it.

00:02:22.466 --> 00:02:24.801
&gt;&gt; And from being there, are you

00:02:24.935 --> 00:02:25.969
surprised from being many that

00:02:26.103 --> 00:02:27.504
moment when she did pass away,

00:02:27.638 --> 00:02:28.472
are you surprised it came from

00:02:28.472 --> 00:02:30.073
there to now the FBI is actually

00:02:30.474 --> 00:02:31.174
looking into this?

00:02:31.308 --> 00:02:32.109
Are you glad?

00:02:32.476 --> 00:02:34.478
&gt;&gt; I contacted my local law

00:02:34.545 --> 00:02:35.045
enforcement when it first

00:02:35.178 --> 00:02:35.412
happened.

00:02:35.546 --> 00:02:37.915
They didn't have a clue who he

00:02:38.048 --> 00:02:40.484
was, where he was at or

00:02:40.551 --> 00:02:40.784
anything.

00:02:40.918 --> 00:02:43.053
So now the feds picked it up.

00:02:43.353 --> 00:02:46.490
I know it is still prosecutable

00:02:46.523 --> 00:02:46.990
at this point.

00:02:47.124 --> 00:02:48.492
I was so relieved.

00:02:48.492 --> 00:02:49.626
And just speaking to the FBI the

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:51.428
little bit that I did was

00:02:51.562 --> 00:02:51.795
cathartic.

00:02:51.929 --> 00:02:54.498
I mean just to get my emotions

00:02:54.498 --> 00:02:55.599
out there and know this is going

00:02:55.732 --> 00:02:55.966
somewhere.

00:02:56.099 --> 00:02:57.634
&gt;&gt; Did they want text messages,

00:02:57.768 --> 00:02:58.502
phone calls?

00:02:58.569 --> 00:02:59.870
&gt;&gt; Text messages.

00:03:00.003 --> 00:03:01.271
They wanted screen shots of

00:03:01.405 --> 00:03:03.574
anything I had from the gofundme

00:03:03.707 --> 00:03:07.210
campaign and off of my Facebook.

00:03:07.344 --> 00:03:07.544
&gt;&gt; Yeah.

00:03:07.678 --> 00:03:10.514
The former deputy director said

00:03:10.547 --> 00:03:13.183
given that it is $3,000 is not

00:03:13.317 --> 00:03:14.151
typically something the FBI

00:03:14.518 --> 00:03:16.987
would look into, he means there

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:18.689
say broader scope of activity

00:03:18.822 --> 00:03:19.823
that Santos is involved in.

00:03:19.957 --> 00:03:21.458
Is that your suspicion as well?

00:03:21.592 --> 00:03:23.126
&gt;&gt; I would put money on it.

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:24.528
I'm not the only one he's done

00:03:24.528 --> 00:03:24.628
this to.

00:03:24.761 --> 00:03:27.564
It was so well lubricated and

00:03:27.698 --> 00:03:30.534
smoothed the way he did

00:03:30.534 --> 00:03:31.368
everything and the talk he had.

00:03:31.501 --> 00:03:34.538
It came out so smooth and

00:03:34.638 --> 00:03:37.407
readily -- didn't -- it was

00:03:37.541 --> 00:03:37.774
rehearsed.

00:03:37.908 --> 00:03:39.343
And as far as the $3,000 is

00:03:39.476 --> 00:03:40.711
concerned, too, I'm not really

00:03:40.844 --> 00:03:43.113
looking to get that back from

00:03:43.246 --> 00:03:43.380
him.

00:03:43.513 --> 00:03:44.881
I don't really think even if he

00:03:45.015 --> 00:03:46.950
had a judgement against him to

00:03:47.084 --> 00:03:51.355
pay it, I don't think I'd ever

00:03:51.488 --> 00:03:55.892
see it anyway.

00:03:56.026 --> 00:03:56.593
George Santos screwed me over

00:03:56.727 --> 00:04:00.564
but I've been getting a lot of

00:04:00.564 --> 00:04:01.131
positive feedback from people

00:04:01.264 --> 00:04:02.799
and America is making it right.

00:04:02.933 --> 00:04:04.267
&gt;&gt; George Santos was asked about

00:04:04.568 --> 00:04:05.736
not just this incident but all

00:04:05.869 --> 00:04:07.237
of the broader lies that have

00:04:07.371 --> 00:04:16.747
been uncovered since he ran for

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:17.981
office.

00:04:18.115 --> 00:04:19.349
&gt;&gt; I know a lot of people want

00:04:19.483 --> 00:04:22.586
to create this narrative that I

00:04:22.586 --> 00:04:23.253
faked my twi congress.

00:04:23.387 --> 00:04:23.954
That is false.

00:04:24.154 --> 00:04:24.821
I worked hard.

00:04:24.955 --> 00:04:26.590
I built ground up a career

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:27.791
through experience and through

00:04:27.924 --> 00:04:29.960
knowledge and through self

00:04:30.093 --> 00:04:30.594
education.

00:04:30.594 --> 00:04:32.796
And, you know, I think it's

00:04:32.929 --> 00:04:34.665
amazing I have to sit here and

00:04:34.798 --> 00:04:35.999
being spoken down to on a

00:04:36.133 --> 00:04:38.835
regular basis yet again by the

00:04:38.969 --> 00:04:39.136
media.

00:04:39.269 --> 00:04:40.604
&gt;&gt; What do you make of those

00:04:40.671 --> 00:04:40.904
comments?

00:04:41.038 --> 00:04:42.606
&gt;&gt; I'm amazed that he's actually

00:04:42.606 --> 00:04:44.775
in a position that he got into.

00:04:44.908 --> 00:04:46.777
I don't understand how he wasn't

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:47.511
vetted out properly.

00:04:47.644 --> 00:04:49.179
I mean, thing dozen happen.

00:04:49.746 --> 00:04:50.814
I understand that.

00:04:50.947 --> 00:04:53.417
It's crazy that this person is

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:55.686
at the position he is right now.

00:04:55.819 --> 00:04:59.356
And he has the possibility of

00:04:59.489 --> 00:05:00.157
passing legislation.

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:01.324
I'm shocked.

00:05:01.458 --> 00:05:03.360
And once I found out who he was,

00:05:03.493 --> 00:05:04.861
it's hurtful to know that.

00:05:04.995 --> 00:05:07.064
This is the person who

00:05:07.197 --> 00:05:08.632
representing our country.

00:05:08.632 --> 00:05:10.133
&gt;&gt; He still a lawmaker.

00:05:10.267 --> 00:05:11.368
He did step down from the

00:05:11.501 --> 00:05:11.768
committees.

00:05:11.902 --> 00:05:12.636
He is still in congress.

00:05:12.636 --> 00:05:14.905
What do you make of him saying

00:05:15.038 --> 00:05:15.839
that he's worked hard.

00:05:15.972 --> 00:05:17.541
He built up this career and

00:05:17.674 --> 00:05:18.642
talking about being spoken down

00:05:18.642 --> 00:05:20.877
to by the media.

00:05:21.011 --> 00:05:25.582
&gt;&gt; He should have had a career

00:05:25.716 --> 00:05:26.783
as a stand up comic.

00:05:26.917 --> 00:05:27.918
He needs to get out of the

00:05:28.051 --> 00:05:28.285
spotlight.

00:05:28.652 --> 00:05:30.020
Step down and get out right now.

00:05:30.153 --> 00:05:32.656
He's just being a distraction.

00:05:32.656 --> 00:05:34.958
Everything that he's doing --

00:05:35.092 --> 00:05:36.159
everything that he's done, it's

00:05:36.293 --> 00:05:36.660
a circus.

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:39.196
It's a media circus behind him.

00:05:39.329 --> 00:05:42.065
And it's making our government

00:05:42.199 --> 00:05:42.666
look bad.

00:05:42.666 --> 00:05:43.066
It really is.

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:44.735
He needs to go.

00:05:44.868 --> 00:05:45.936
And that's probably the way he

00:05:46.069 --> 00:05:47.370
can say he's sorry better than

00:05:47.504 --> 00:05:47.971
any other way.

00:05:48.105 --> 00:05:49.539
&gt;&gt; What does it say to you that

00:05:49.673 --> 00:05:50.307
he's not answering questions

00:05:50.674 --> 00:05:51.775
about any of these allegations?

00:05:51.908 --> 00:05:55.378
&gt;&gt; He's heartless and has no

00:05:55.512 --> 00:05:57.347
moral come pass and no shame.

00:05:57.481 --> 00:05:59.416
No remorse.

00:05:59.549 --> 00:06:01.017
He's like a super villain.

00:06:01.151 --> 00:06:02.686
&gt;&gt; Does he owe you a public

00:06:02.686 --> 00:06:02.786
apology?

00:06:02.919 --> 00:06:04.254
&gt;&gt; I believe so.

00:06:04.688 --> 00:06:05.088
I believe so.

00:06:05.222 --> 00:06:06.690
At least acknowledgement that he

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:09.659
remembers me and remembers that

00:06:09.793 --> 00:06:10.093
this happened.

00:06:10.227 --> 00:06:10.994
&gt;&gt; Thank you, Michael.

00:06:11.161 --> 00:06:14.231
I know this is painful thing for

00:06:14.364 --> 00:06:14.965
you to talk about and to bring

